f=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Chocolate\"><img alt=\"Bar of Chocolate\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bar_of_Chocolate_988acd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Chocolate\">Bar of Chocolate</a> to make a <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Lump of Chocolate Dough</strong>. \n</p><p>Used to make <a href=\"#/wiki/Chocolate%20Cake\">Chocolate Cakes</a>, aswell as <a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbread%20Key\">Gingerbread Keys</a> which are made during the Sweet Dreams quest to access <a href=\"#/wiki/Candia\">Candia</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>In a small patch on 10 November 2009 its weight was changed from 5.00 oz to 1.00 oz.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Chocolate\">Bar of Chocolate</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Keep%20Isle\">Cake Keep Isle</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chocolate%20Cake\">Chocolate Cake</a></li><li>Cooking</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">Flour</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbread%20Key\">Gingerbread Key</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">Milk</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-hidden-city-of-beregar-quest\">The Hidden City of Beregar Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/threatened-dreams-quest\">Threatened Dreams Quest</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["the-hidden-city-of-beregar-quest","threatened-dreams-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"the-hidden-city-of-beregar-quest","quest":"The Hidden City of Beregar Quest","step":"3-1","n":22,"title":"Fazer o Chocolate Cake","kind":"mention","coords":[]},{"slug":"threatened-dreams-quest","quest":"Threatened Dreams Quest","step":"7-6","n":71,"title":"Fazer a massa de chocolate","kind":"mention","coords":[]},{"slug":"threatened-dreams-quest","quest":"Threatened Dreams Quest","step":"7-10","n":75,"title":"Cozer a Gingerbread Key","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":33517,"y":32231,"z":6,"label":"Forno (1 andar acima)"}]}]}}